Maintainer: Ion Reguera <ion@stagelab.coop>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.0

Package: cuems-common
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         cuems-utils (>= 1.0.0),
         systemd,
         python3,
         kwin-wayland,
         apache2,
         openssl,
         avahi-daemon,
         isc-dhcp-server,
         hostapd,
         rsync,
         iproute2,
         ddcutil
Description: CUEMS common configuration and systemd services
 This package contains systemd service files, configuration files,
 and scripts required for CUEMS operation.
 .
 All Python scripts use /usr/lib/cuems/bin/python3 provided by
 the cuems-utils package.
 .
 This package requires isc-dhcp-server and hostapd for WiFi access
 point functionality (cuems-wifi.service and hostapd.service).
 .
 This package uses Wayland (kwin-wayland) for display server
 functionality (cuems-wayland.service).
 .
 This package installs Apache2 site configuration files and enables
 required Apache2 modules and sites. Module files are provided by their
 respective Debian packages (libapache2-mod-*).

